## Deploy commands

```bash
cd ~/github/mozentai
bundle exec jekyll build   # local verify
git push origin main       # triggers GitHub Pages
gh run watch $(gh run list --workflow=pages.yml --limit 1 --json databaseId --jq '.[0].databaseId')
```

